WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:02.026
[ MUSIC PLAYING ]

00:00:02.026 --> 00:00:03.280
- I need you to know something.

00:00:05.333 --> 00:00:06.393
What happened before, 

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:09.360
the girl who did that -- 

00:00:10.266 --> 00:00:11.526
I don't even recognize.

00:00:11.953 --> 00:00:14.470
- The story totally revolves around Sophie.

00:00:14.470 --> 00:00:16.793
And we've always said that she's the investigator,

00:00:16.793 --> 00:00:18.790
but she's also the investigation.

00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:20.526
Like, who was she, really?

00:00:20.746 --> 00:00:22.180
- When we first meet Sophie,

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:24.390
she's in quite a vulnerable state.

00:00:24.390 --> 00:00:28.140
She's had to be placed
under a conservatorship,

00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:29.720
by her husband James.

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:32.090
- Just trying to do the right thing.
- I know, but,

00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:33.290
I'm better now.

00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:37.200
James hasn't said an awful lot
about the accident to her.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:39.640
For him, it's a chance

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:42.126
for their whole relationship to start fresh.

00:00:42.553 --> 00:00:45.440
To have a lead character who
really doesn't know who she is,

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:48.000
and who really has to go on
a journey of rediscovery,

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.470
it makes her incredibly easy to identify with.

00:00:50.470 --> 00:00:53.230
- Sophie appears to be this very demure,

00:00:53.230 --> 00:00:56.020
traditional, good wife, but something about that

00:00:56.020 --> 00:00:58.100
rings hollow to her from the beginning.

00:00:58.340 --> 00:01:00.280
- Stepping into the outside world,

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:02.440
raises more questions than answers,

00:01:02.440 --> 00:01:05.353
in terms of what she's been led to believe her life was.

00:01:06.546 --> 00:01:08.993
- Sophie.
- Im sorry, do I know you?

00:01:09.406 --> 00:01:10.553
- We need to talk.

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:13.390
- To be stripped of the pieces of your past

00:01:13.390 --> 00:01:14.610
that make you who you are

00:01:14.610 --> 00:01:17.450
and then to be told who you are
by people around you,

00:01:17.450 --> 00:01:19.340
that becomes very interesting.

00:01:19.340 --> 00:01:21.340
- Sophie is an incredibly complex,

00:01:21.340 --> 00:01:23.100
compelling character,

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:27.020
and what unfolds in the show is unlike anything
audiences have seen before.

00:01:27.346 --> 00:01:29.580
- Take a mark.
- Action.

00:01:29.580 --> 00:01:31.860
- Tell me who you are, right now.

00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:34.280
- Gugu is a spectacular actress,

00:01:34.280 --> 00:01:37.230
and in this role, she has a challenge of

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:39.640
not just being the Sophie that we meet in the pilot,

00:01:39.640 --> 00:01:41.960
but being all the different versions of Sophie.

00:01:41.960 --> 00:01:44.610
Gugu plays the character in such an engaging way,

00:01:44.610 --> 00:01:46.620
the character is so sympathetic because,

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:49.330
in a very sort of, real way, it pulls apart

00:01:49.330 --> 00:01:51.680
what happens if you're not who you really are.

00:01:52.466 --> 00:01:54.770
- There are depths to her that will go places

00:01:54.770 --> 00:01:57.000
that I think are really going to surprise people.

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:59.500
- People are going to be really asking the question,

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:01.470
what would you do in Sophie's situation,

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:03.780
if you really didn't know any of your own secrets?

00:02:03.926 --> 00:02:05.853
I hope people really enjoy the ride.

00:02:05.853 --> 00:02:07.850
[ MUSIC PLAYING ]

